🐍 Python Tools (Important for Beginners & DevOps)

Since you are learning Linux, Git, Docker & DevOps, these Python tools will help you a lot 👇

🔹 1. 🧑‍💻 Code Editors (Where you write Python code)

Visual Studio Code – Most popular editor

PyCharm – Special IDE for Python

Jupyter Notebook – Good for data & practice

🔹 2. 📦 Package Management Tools

pip – Install Python libraries
Example:

pip install requests

virtualenv – Create separate environments

Poetry – Modern dependency manager

🔹 3. 🧪 Testing Tools

pytest – Simple and powerful testing tool

unittest – Built-in Python testing module

🔹 4. 🌐 Web Development Frameworks

Django – Full website framework

Flask – Lightweight web framework

FastAPI – Modern & fast API framework

🔹 5. 🤖 Automation / DevOps Tools

Ansible – Uses Python internally

Fabric – Remote server automation

🔹 6. 📊 Data & AI Tools

NumPy – Mathematical operations

Pandas – Data handling

TensorFlow – AI & ML

